    "title": "Trustworthy signals: feature health and analytics get rebuilt",
    "intro": "Today's nightly focuses on the signals Aura relies on to know whether the product is actually working. The status dashboard learns to tell feature health apart from the runtime it was observed in, and the analytics pipeline gets a contract-tested rebuild so True DAU, retention, and reliability numbers can be trusted across web, desktop, and mobile.",
    "entries": [
